    "text": "The thermostat, temperature sensor and electronic control are checked.",
    "border": "border-rose-500"
  },
  {
    "title": "The fan is not working",
    "text": "The fan motor, power supply and control components are checked.",
    "border": "border-indigo-500"
  },
  {
    "title": "The oven does not turn on",
    "text": "The power supply, electrical connections, safety components and controls are checked.",
    "border": "border-yellow-500"
  },
  {
    "title": "The oven switches off during operation",
    "text": "It checks when the problem occurs and which components are running at that moment.",
    "border": "border-teal-500"
  },
  {
    "title": "The oven turns off the fuse",
    "text": "The cause could be an electrical defect, heater, wiring, or other component.",
    "border": "border-red-600"
  },
  {
